tenomi-rover
Copyright 2026 koh aiaida

This repository contains the source code of the application layer (app_rover)
of the Rover, the driving unit of TENOMI. The source code in this repository is
provided under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (hereinafter "Apache-2.0").
For the full license text, see the accompanying LICENSE file.

This repository does not contain any third-party source code.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Not included in this repository

The following software is required to build, but none of it is included in
this repository. Obtain each of them separately from its provider.

1. μT-Kernel 3.0 (micro:bit version)
   Provider: Personal Media Corporation (hereinafter PMC)
   Source: https://www.t-engine4u.com/info/mbit/2.html (362_mbit_mtk3.zip)
   The μT-Kernel 3.0 (micro:bit version) distributed by PMC is not included
   in this repository. When using it, follow the distribution terms of
   Personal Media Corporation.

2. benus (makes the BLE Nordic UART Service available as a μT-Kernel device
   driver)
   Source: https://github.com/koh523/benus
   License: Apache-2.0
   benus contains third-party software, such as SoftDevice S113 and the
   nRF5 SDK by Nordic Semiconductor ASA. For their license terms, see the
   NOTICE file of benus.

